WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:16.228
cried Princess Badra.

2
00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.609
"Magrib is coming!

3
00:00:19.129 --> 00:00:20.290
I must look my best.

4
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.850
Bring me my pearls."

5
00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:27.592
Her attendants ran in circles, and one went downstairs to open the gate.

6
00:00:29.484 --> 00:00:33.567
When the princess heard Magrib's footsteps in the hall, she opened the door.

7
00:00:33.587 --> 00:00:36.889
"Welcome!" she said with a smile.

8
00:00:36.909 --> 00:00:39.230
"Come in, dear man."

9
00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.692
The magician didn't know what to say.

10
00:00:42.952 --> 00:00:45.334
Usually she didn't want him around her.

11
00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:50.337
"Princess, I—," he said shyly.

12
00:00:50.357 --> 00:00:55.000
"Oh, you look so handsome," said the princess.

13
00:00:57.084 --> 00:00:57.705
"Sit down!

14
00:00:58.165 --> 00:01:00.346
No—not there—sit here!"

15
00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:05.730
The princess took Magrib's hand and led him to the cushion beside her.

16
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.254
"I have been so lonely," she said.

17
00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:13.236
"You must visit more often."

18
00:01:13.256 --> 00:01:19.720
"Princess, I'm so glad to hear you say that," said Magrib happily.

19
00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.324
"I've been sad long enough," said the princess.

20
00:01:25.536 --> 00:01:27.397
"Tears will not bring Aladdin back.

21
00:01:28.718 --> 00:01:30.458
So I'm not going to think about him."

22
00:01:32.379 --> 00:01:34.460
She moved a little closer to Magrib.

23
00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:37.942
"I'm going to think about you."

24
00:01:37.962 --> 00:01:42.304
"Oh, Princess," sighed Magrib.

25
00:01:43.445 --> 00:01:45.045
He tried to give her a kiss.

26
00:01:46.326 --> 00:01:50.328
But the princess suddenly jumped up and said, "We must have wine!"

27
00:01:52.472 --> 00:01:55.074
"You are so kind," said Magrib.

28
00:01:55.094 --> 00:02:02.180
"We should get to know each other—" "Oh, we will," replied the princess.

29
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.543
"But first, let's make a toast."

30
00:02:08.726 --> 00:02:10.607
She poured wine into two cups.

31
00:02:10.627 --> 00:02:12.689
"To our happiness!"

32
00:02:12.709 --> 00:02:15.492
"To our happiness!"

33
00:02:16.192 --> 00:02:16.953
said Magrib.

34
00:02:18.094 --> 00:02:20.356
The princess took a tiny sip.

35
00:02:20.944 --> 00:02:23.965
Magrib drank all his wine in one gulp.

36
00:02:25.065 --> 00:02:26.906
The princess poured more wine.

37
00:02:26.926 --> 00:02:31.747
"Good wine," she said and took another sip.

38
00:02:33.407 --> 00:02:36.768
Magrib emptied his cup, and she poured him more wine.

39
00:02:38.009 --> 00:02:42.190
Magrib drank cup after cup until he felt a bit sleepy.

40
00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.470
"Another toast!"

41
00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.051
shouted the princess.

42
00:02:46.071 --> 00:02:47.351
"To Magrib!"

43
00:02:49.432 --> 00:02:53.317
Magrib drank, giggled, and fell over backward.

44
00:02:54.537 --> 00:02:56.058
The cup fell from his hand.

45
00:02:56.658 --> 00:02:59.479
And he started to snore—loudly.

46
00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.861
called Princess Badra, leaping up.

47
00:03:06.881 --> 00:03:12.502
"Come!" Aladdin rushed in, pulled the lamp from Magrib's coat, and rubbed.

48
00:03:14.503 --> 00:03:17.904
Smoke poured from the lamp and the high melody returned.

49
00:03:19.592 --> 00:03:21.614
"Your wish is my command!"

50
00:03:22.294 --> 00:03:23.035
said the genie.

51
00:03:23.055 --> 00:03:25.477
"Ah, it's you, Aladdin!"

52
00:03:26.778 --> 00:03:28.619
Then he saw Magrib on the floor.

53
00:03:28.639 --> 00:03:30.981
"I never liked him."

54
00:03:31.001 --> 00:03:35.244
"Genie," said Aladdin, "fly this palace home!"

55
00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:39.147
"I hear and obey, master!"

56
00:03:39.768 --> 00:03:40.588
said the genie.

57
00:03:41.789 --> 00:03:44.812
The genie picked up the palace and started to fly.

58
00:03:46.256 --> 00:03:49.637
Aladdin and Princess Badra hugged each other as they flew home.

59
00:03:51.658 --> 00:03:55.038
The palace landed with a thud, which woke up Magrib.

60
00:03:56.319 --> 00:04:00.240
When he saw Aladdin, he stood up and screamed with rage.

61
00:04:04.141 --> 00:04:07.462
Then he jumped out the palace window and ran away.

62
00:04:09.923 --> 00:04:14.764
Well, you must imagine the sultan sadly looking out his window that morning.

63
00:04:16.164 --> 00:04:19.807
Suddenly Aladdin's palace came down from the sky.

64
00:04:20.408 --> 00:04:22.589
His daughter was waving from the window.

65
00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:28.354
Full of joy, the sultan hurried down the red carpet to greet the happy couple.

66
00:04:30.576 --> 00:04:34.539
He ordered his guards to bring Zeba to the palace for a big party.

67
00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:39.643
Everyone in the kingdom was invited to celebrate his daughter's return.

68
00:04:40.884 --> 00:04:42.646
Everyone but the grand vizier.

69
00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:45.348
He had to stay in his room.

70
00:04:48.292 --> 00:04:51.353
Aladdin and Princess Badra never saw Magrib again.

71
00:04:52.674 --> 00:04:55.475
They lived long lives and had many children.

72
00:04:56.836 --> 00:04:59.256
In time, Aladdin became sultan.

73
00:05:00.457 --> 00:05:03.378
He ruled in peace and the people loved him.

74
00:05:05.779 --> 00:05:08.140
So this story has a happy ending.

75
00:05:09.441 --> 00:05:12.222
That's another reason my king likes it so well.

76
00:05:13.322 --> 00:05:14.963
Would you like to hear another story?

77
00:05:16.363 --> 00:05:19.230
Oh, not today, but some other day.

78
00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.212
I know a thousand more!

79
00:05:22.433 --> 00:05:23.995
Would you like to hear the one about
